          "name": "Improper Limitation of a Pathname to a Restricted Directory ('Path Traversal')"
        },
        "discovery_date": "2025-11-28T15:01:10.693633+00:00",
        "ids": [
          {
            "system_name": "Red Hat Bugzilla ID",
            "text": "2417711"
